Here is the draft budget for review. No journal wrapper was ever applied to
this copy -- Postfix's always_bcc simply opens a fresh SMTP transaction to
the archive mailbox with this message's own bytes as the payload, which is
exactly why the true Bcc/DL recipient list never reaches this receiver.
